{"step_index":1244,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T14:40:14Z","content":"In Centreon Web (**Administration > Extensions > Options**), configure the two fields as follows:\n\n---\n\n### 1. **MAP Engine server address**\n*(Accessed directly by users' web browsers)*\n\n```text\nhttps://map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr:9443\n```\n> [!TIP]\n> Do not put a trailing slash `/` at the end.\n\n---\n\n### 2. **MAP server address as seen by Central**\n*(Accessed internally by the Centreon Central PHP backend)*\n\n```text\nhttps://map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr:9443\n```\n\n---\n\n### 3. **MAP Engine server** (Radio button)\n* Select **Yes**\n\n---\n\n### What to expect when testing:\n\nClick **\"Test connection to server\"** next to both fields:\n* **MAP Engine server address** $\\rightarrow$ <span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">Green Check</span>\n* **MAP server address as seen by Central** $\\rightarrow$ <span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">Green Check</span>\n\nThen scroll to the bottom and click **Save**."}
